cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DietView, please cite it as below."
title: "DietView: An R package for interactive, hierarchical visualization of predator stomach-content data"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  DietView turns a long table of stomach-content records into interactive,
  hierarchical views of predator diet. It attaches a taxonomic lineage from the
  World Register of Marine Species (with a log of how each prey was matched) or
  from a user-supplied lineage table, keeps prey identified only to a coarse
  rank as an explicit unidentified category below that rank, summarizes the diet
  by prey records, numbers and weight at every rank, reports how identification
  depth changes with digestion, and renders the result as a Shiny app, a
  self-contained HTML dashboard or plotly figures.
type: software
authors:
